OL,3,APM pledges #210m to regenerate UK's
OL,4,Ahigh streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has announced a
OL,7,F#210m package to regenerate the UK's
OL,8,Fcommunities and high streets.
OL,10,FEmpty spaces will be put back into use,
OL,11,FAndy Burnham said, turning them into
OL,12,F"community hubs, health centres, shared
OL,13,Fworkspaces, cafes and the local
OL,14,Fservices that people actually want to
OL,15,Fsee."
OL,17,FThe scheme is part of funding earmarked
OL,18,Fby the Ministry of Housing, Communities
OL,19,Fand Local Government for high street
OL,20,Fsupport and regeneration.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
