OL,3,APM pledges #210m to regenerate UK's
OL,4,Ahigh streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes ahead of Burnham's first
OL,7,FLabour Party conference as prime
OL,8,Fminister, where he is set to emphasise
OL,9,Fhis plans for the UK will have "making
OL,10,Flife more affordable" at its core.
